abstract: >-
  Monte Carlo simulation software for magnetron sputter deposition.
  Couples a SRIM-type target-emission stage with a SIMTRA-type gas-phase
  transport stage using hard-sphere binary-collision kinematics and an
  energy-dependent mean free path. Models the sputtered-particle chain from
  emission at the target through gas-phase scattering to deposition on the
  substrate, with built-in visualization, parametric sweeps, and results
  export. Distributed as a self-contained Windows executable.
